  "ruleText": "Jus 602.09 “Commission preparation” means the stage of the claim process during which the claimant secures the necessary documentation and information to support the claim.\n\nSource. #9553, eff 9-25-09, EXPIRED: 9-25-17\n\nNew. #12938, eff 12-9-19 (formerly Jus 602.08)",
